    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twilight Syndicate is an adventure game where players take on the role of a rookie Interpol detective tracking criminals across the globe. Armed with only a initial clue, players must investigate locations, follow trails, and piece together evidence to capture their targets. Along the way, they uncover the secrets of the Twilight Syndicate, a shadowy organization tied to legendary heists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twilight Syndicate offers a campaign mode where players solve cases and uncover the truth about the Twilight Syndicate. The game begins with the player receiving a clue that leads them to a specific location. Players travel, talk to NPCs, and investigate for more leads. Each location presents challenges like finding hidden clues or solving puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on exploration, deduction, and decision-making. Every choice matters, keeping players engaged as they uncover the Twilight Syndicate's secrets and get closer to capturing the main antagonist initially know as &quot;The Gentleman&quot;.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twilight Syndicate is an adventure game where players take on the role of a rookie Interpol detective tracking criminals across the globe. Armed with only a initial clue, players must investigate locations, follow trails, and piece together evidence to capture their targets. Along the way, they uncover the secrets of the Twilight Syndicate, a shadowy organization tied to legendary heists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twilight Syndicate offers a campaign mode where players solve cases and uncover the truth about the Twilight Syndicate. The game begins with the player receiving a clue that leads them to a specific location. Players travel, talk to NPCs, and investigate for more leads. Each location presents challenges like finding hidden clues or solving puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on exploration, deduction, and decision-making. Every choice matters, keeping players engaged as they uncover the Twilight Syndicate's secrets and get closer to capturing the main antagonist initially know as &quot;The Gentleman&quot;.</p>",
    "short_description": "Uncover global crimes as an Interpol rookie in this thrilling detective adventure. Chase clues, and expose the Twilight Syndicate!",
